# Copy to `.env` for local development, or set as a repo secret in
# GitHub Actions (already wired in .github/workflows/deploy.yml).
#
# IMPORTANT: any VITE_* variable is PUBLIC — it is bundled into the client-side
# JavaScript and visible to every visitor. This URL is safe to expose because
# the actual protections (CORS origin check, rate limiting, Resend API key)
# live inside the Worker itself.
#
# Full URL to the deployed Cloudflare Worker's /contact endpoint, e.g.
# https://kapture-contact.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev/contact
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
